==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 75,000 and increases by 25,000 with each stage.
*7 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Hyppoh]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Bearkini]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.

