==Strategy==
Beware! The aliens in this gauntlet start out at ITF 1 magnifications, but then reach ITF 3 levels at Level 7, and cap at out 1000% at the 10th level. Just deal with the Aliens at the start, and bring ranged attackers or tankers like Dragon Cat to deal with the Sunny Celeboodle.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.6 Update|version 11.6]], Summer Lv.1~10 had a restriction of "Cat Deploy Cost: Only 4,000¢ or less", rather than a Cat Deploy Limit of 10.

